Perform Leap 1 (Current baselines → complete diagnostic → hierarchy audit → narrative architecture → major proposed before/afters → my recommended redesign.  ):
Checkpoint 1: 

-  audit all three baselines and the private brief; 
-  classify every meaningful defect using the hierarchy we established; 
-  identify recurring distortions such as CPI → governance, DFAST → decision trees, furnishing project → 100M+ statistic; 
-  map the strongest professional stories and supporting metrics/methods; 
-  redesign the executive-profile architecture; 
-  redesign each employer introduction; 
-  propose the major substantive changes across Wells Fargo, OCC, Census, and portfolio treatment; 
-  show you the highest-impact before/after language; 
-  identify anything I think should be removed, demoted, expanded, or relocated.
